# P0.4C Blind Reviewer Pack — Standing Reminder

## What these files are

Operator-local **blind** workbooks for independent human labeling (Reviewer A / Reviewer B).
They are **not** the source `Unstandard_LabelingDataset_v0.1.xlsx`. They must stay
**outside Git**, outside chat dumps, and off model/API/Vercel/embedding paths.

Verified upload artifacts (this environment, structure-only):

| Role | Upload basename (suffix may vary) | SHA-256 |
|---|---|---|
| Reviewer A | `P0.4C_Reviewer_A_Blind_Workbook_*.xlsx` | `e71832672a6c7528453809f273a04337ffbff8c9aa6a2ee979fdf228c3727b79` |
| Reviewer B | `P0.4C_Reviewer_B_Blind_Workbook_*.xlsx` | `1b8bcc0245ca52424d8e0760595cf8798b4f66478621e4c34417173d2730fccd` |

Do **not** treat SHA as a substitute for the source workbook hash. Source workbook
